    feat(75-01): add finite-only shutdown_drain_timeout GeneralConfig field
    
    - Field(default=60.0, ge=1.0, allow_inf_nan=False) — no upper bound on model
    - ge=1.0 rejects zero/negative to prevent a typo disabling the drain
    - allow_inf_nan=False rejects inf/nan (ge=1.0 alone accepts +inf in pydantic v2)
    - Config value is default; TRIGGARR_SHUTDOWN_DRAIN_TIMEOUT env overrides at shutdown

